        "author": "sira-fiinikkusu",
        "description": "Turns reTerminal Sticky into a full Home Assistant Assist satellite: speak to your assistant and read the complete reply as ink. Eight touch pages cover a clock dashboard, notes, a tap-to-check shopping list, today's agenda, a 3-day forecast, room lighting controls, live voice timers with an on-device alarm, and a household board \u2014 dictate a note on one Sticky and every unit in the house beeps and shows it. A wake-cause-aware deep-sleep cycle reports battery and climate sensors every 15 minutes while keeping the screen calm, and one base config scales to a whole fleet of named units. Requires Home Assistant with the ESPHome integration and an Assist pipeline; first-boot Wi-Fi setup happens through a captive portal or Improv over USB.",
